# DocAtlas Cursor Platform

This project was initialized from the **Cursor Platform** line (`distribution: cursor`, branch `cursor/cursor-native-95c0`). That line is **not merged into `main`** — see toolkit `docs/BRANCHING.md`.

## Background doc sync

- Use **Cursor Automations** and prompts under `doc-atlas/cursor/prompts/`
- GitHub Action templates are optional (`--with-github-actions` at init)
- Run `docatlas update` and `docatlas drift` before LLM doc edits

## In-session changes

Follow `docatlas-skill-update` for architecture-sensitive work; use MCP `query_project_docs` before rewriting large doc sections.
